, 8)` returns `'hello w…'` (8 characters). Text that already fits comes back unchanged, and `max` of 1 returns just `'…'`.\n\nTwo choices I made that you didn't specify:\n- **Length is counted in UTF-16 code units**, which is what `.length` measures in JavaScript. For text with emoji or other characters outside the Basic Multilingual Plane, a cut could split a character in half. If you want it to count by code point, I can switch it to `Array.from`.\n- **`max <= 0` returns an empty string.** Without that check, a `max` of 0 would return `'…'`, which is one character too many.","ttft_ms":1447,"type":"result","duration_ms":6796,"uuid":"145a9232-1bc2-4e07-b8b7-5784ddaa6b7a","ttft_stream_ms":1078,"time_to_request_ms":401,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":331,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":12,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"tool_pool_refresh":2,"init_message":4,"init_frame_send":2,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":4,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":16,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":7},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":24,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":102,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":209,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":130,"process_rss_mib_result":228,"process_anon_mib_result":136,"process_peak_rss_mib":235,"process_cpu_ms_turn":636,"process_wall_ms_turn":6795,"tool_pool_build_count":3,"tool_pool_build_lapsed_count":0,"tool_pool_moved_at_lapse_count":0,"tool_pool_limit_ms":30000,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":229,"process_wall_ms_streaming":4354,"main_stream_count":3,"main_stream_event_count":172,"main_stream_chunk_count":139,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":229,"wall_ms":4354,"entries":3},"tool":{"cpu_ms":46,"wall_ms":86,"entries":2},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":216,"wall_ms":1914,"entries":3},"before_